{"title":"Large Coral Snake","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 12 Snake that attacks with corrode (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .6 | venomDamage: 16 | venomDurationMs: 8e3</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(91.0px,-70.6px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:-92.8px;top:72.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-95.6px;top:71.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:-79.1px;top:70.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-107.9px;top:66.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:-107.9px;top:85.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-125.1px;top:115.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-110.7px;top:107.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-114.8px;top:107.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-122.4px;top:123.4px\"></i></div><figcaption>Rustpick Mine</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a> <